nswers but also i'm really tired of  words  we'd like to see some action now and  just finally do you think the u.s  government  can help get your dad out  i think they they've been working on it  just as hard the state department and  foreign office work in tandem but again  he this is home to him this is who he is  so  and that was who promised us the results  the uk said to us that he was going to  be in the deal  and do you think he do you think you'll  get him back  i can't think about if i don't get him  back because  he he was  i mean he is he it's you can't even say  past tense or present tense anymore  because it's so  complicated but  when it's your dad it's your dad there's  there's no love like the love a daughter  or a son has for a father

